          "text": "Quality auditors noted restricted clearance for equipment while preparing a replacement frame. An observer stands 18 m from a vertical tower at the seismic sensor enclosure. The angle of elevation from eye level to the top is 60°, and the observer’s eye is 1.6 m above the ground. Find the tower height correct to 1 decimal place."
